      "topic_id": "simplifying_indices_challenging",
      "prompt": "Simplify 25^(3/2) × 25^-2, giving your answer as a fraction where necessary.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "25^(1/2) is the square root of 25, which is 5, so 25^(3/2) = 5^3",
        "25^-2 = 1/25^2 = 1/5^4",
        "25^(3/2) × 25^-2 = 5^3 × 1/5^4 = 5^(3-4) = 5^-1",
        "5^-1 = 1/5"
      ],
      "final_answer": "1/5",
